EXPERIMENT 5 – Add Digits (LeetCode 258)

AIM:
To implement an efficient algorithm to repeatedly add the digits of an integer until a single-digit result is obtained.

ALGORITHM:
i) Start the program.
ii) Initialize the given integer num.
iii) Repeat the process while num contains more than one digit.
iv) Initialize sum = 0.
v) Extract the last digit using num % 10 and add it to sum.
vi) Remove the last digit using integer division num // 10.
vii) Assign sum to num and repeat the process.
viii) When num becomes a single digit, return num.
ix) Stop the program.

CODE:
class Solution:
    def addDigits(self, num: int) -> int:
        while num >= 10:
            total = 0

            while num > 0:
                total += num % 10
                num //= 10

            num = total

        return num
